{'symbol': 'DLTR', 'date': '2020-03-31 09:30:00', 'title': 'DOLLAR TREE PROVIDES BUSINESS UPDATE RELATED TO COVID-19', 'text': "DOLLAR TREE, INC. PROVIDES BUSINESS UPDATE RELATED TO COVID-19.DOLLAR TREE INC - SAME-STORE SALES TRENDS THROUGH MARCH 29, QUARTER-TO-DATE SAME-STORE SALES WERE +7.1% FOR DOLLAR TREE AND +14.4% FOR FAMILY DOLLAR.DOLLAR TREE - BOARD REMAINS ENGAGED, HAS BEEN BRIEFED ON CO'S ACTIONS IN RESPONSE TO COVID-19 AND IMPACT ON CO AND STAKEHOLDERS.DOLLAR TREE INC SAYS WITHDRAWING ITS OUTLOOK FOR Q1 AND FULL-YEAR FISCAL 2020.DOLLAR TREE INC SAYS IN PROCESS OF REASSESSING ITS FULL-YEAR FISCAL 2020 PLANS AND INITIATIVES GIVEN CURRENT STATE OF UNCERTAINTY.DOLLAR TREE INC SAYS ALL FAMILY DOLLAR H2 RENOVATIONS AND DOLLAR TREE SNACK ZONE INSTALLATIONS HAVE BEEN SUSPENDED THROUGH AT LEAST APRIL 27.DOLLAR TREE INC SAYS DOES NOT EXPECT TO REPURCHASE SHARES IN NEAR TERM UNDER CURRENT SHARE REPURCHASE AUTHORIZATION THAT HAS $800 MILLION REMAINING."}